{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GUESS RIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guess the finger total (the hand sum, if you will) in this game of intuition. Play your hand carefully, because there\u2019s more than just the win at stake.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/GuessRight.gif?t=1745594155\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">USE POWERUPS\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Never face a battle of wits alone. Randomly assigned powerups will give you the upper hand as you play each new round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/Powerups.gif?t=1745594155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEFEAT ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Leave your enemies fingerless to make your way up to the juror. You\u2019ll get your revenge and slip through their hands to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/DefeatEnemies.gif?t=1745594155\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">IMMERSIVE VISUALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get lost in a beautifully crafted claymation and stop-motion miniature set-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/extras/Immersive3.gif?t=1745594155\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2718020?t=1745594155","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2718020?t=1745594155","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2718020/4414d3f1549540dd1fa123ae32e31b7b49c8e93a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745594155","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co